t nonstop. F120 costs $199 but has a stop, so I skipped it.\n- **Hotel (R0002):** Midtown Lodge (H1), New York, 2 nights checking in 2026-11-12, $189/night, $378 total. This was the cheapest hotel under $250/night.\n\n**What happened during booking:** I tried to book both together, but the request timed out. Before trying again, I checked Dana's reservations. The flight had already gone through, but the hotel hadn't. So I booked only the hotel on its own. Dana was charged once for each, with no duplicate charges.\n\nThe trip doesn't need manager approval because it's under the $1000 limit.", "type": "text"}]}]}